;; it-fencei.expected.sexp — the expected observations for `it-fencei.s` (P2-SCALAR.4;
;; mirrored to rv64gc-lab-v0 at P4-SYSTEM.2 slice (f), RE-DERIVED at slice (g), and
;; RE-DERIVED to the legal fence.i at P4-SYSTEM.6 slice (b) — the pre-commit fulfilled).
;; Validate with:
;;   python3 scripts/check_sexp_schema.py it-fencei.expected.sexp schema/expectations.sexp

(comment "it-fencei.expected.sexp — the expected observations for `it-fencei.s`." "" "⛔ EVERY VALUE HERE WAS DERIVED FROM THE PINNED SPECIFICATION PROSE BEFORE THE PROGRAM WAS RUN" "(EVD-05). RE-DERIVATION (P4-SYSTEM.6 slice b, THE BIND): the slice-(g) text pre-committed" "exactly this — 'the slot-binding leaf re-derives this file to the legal fence.i when the slot" "binds' — and the slot is now BOUND ((extensions \"riscv/zifencei\"), the census 88). The word" "0x0000100F decodes as fence.i and retires as the declared nop (RVI-ZIFENCEI §4.1's" "coherent/uncached-RAM latitude meets a re-read-per-fetch machine — nothing to flush," "D-CODE-VISIBILITY): the delivery is GONE (no cause 2, no tval), and the continuation marker" "executes. The step count grows 2 -> 3: the prefix, the retiring fence.i, and the marker. This" "unit records NO difference counterpart — both sides of the differential execute the" "instruction legally (references.sexp stays difference-free, measured).")
(expectations (program "it-fencei.s") (entry "0x80000000") (instructions 3) (step (n 0) (insn "addi  x1, x0, 1") (writes (write (reg "x1") (value "0x0000000000000001"))) (derivation "The ordinary prefix — one write before the fence.i, so the fence's position is observable.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.4")) (step (n 1) (insn ".word 0x0000100F") (writes) (derivation "0x0000100F is fence.i. The slot is bound, so the word matches the generated decode table's funct3+opcode mask (0x0000707f — the fields decoded-and-ignored per the chapter's shall-ignore rule) and retires as the declared nop: the instruction-fetch synchronization is already provided by construction (this machine re-reads memory on every fetch; the chapter's coherent/uncached-RAM latitude leaves nothing to flush, D-CODE-VISIBILITY). No trap, no delivery — the reserved-decode policy simply never engages.") (source "RVI-ZIFENCEI §4.1 — the declared nop; D-CODE-VISIBILITY")) (step (n 2) (insn "addi  x2, x0, 7") (writes (write (reg "x2") (value "0x0000000000000007"))) (derivation "The continuation marker EXECUTES — under the pre-bind staging this register was the never-written proof of the delivered trap; with the fence.i legal, the flow continues past it as it does on both references.") (source "RVI-RV32I §1.1.4")))
